+including mitigations with no specified end time.</dd>
+          <dt pn="section-2.5-2.11">DM-006</dt>
+          <dd pn="section-2.5-2.12">Mitigation Efficacy Representation: The data model <bcp14>MUST</bcp14>
+support representation of a DOTS client's understanding of the
